WEBVTT

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:46.040
<b>Cosplay Club</b>

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:42.910
Prison role playing?

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:46.040
Yes, I play the prisoner, and he plays the guard.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:49.350
Could you give me some more detail?

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:50.740
Like some examples of what you were doing.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.050
And I don't mean in a dirty way.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.520
Is that even relevant?

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:57.790
He would always handcuff and blindfold

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.600
our girls before running off without paying.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.370
Can you be more specific?

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.560
How about we reenact the scene with me playing the guard.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.230
Gin-san, do you still remember why we're here?

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.980
I've heard that he's a dangerous guy with backdoor gang connections,

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.900
so our hands are tied.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.850
Don't worry, I'm also a backdoor kind of person.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.280
So could you head out the backdoor and wait in those handcuffs for me?

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.750
Gin-san, cut it out.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:23.750
So we just have to get him to pay up?

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.240
Welcome.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.630
Oh, I think he's here.

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.060
He's all yours.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.450
I would like the prison role playing service again.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.850
Sir, I am impressed to see you wearing a guard uniform.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:40.770
<b>Weekly Ranking</b>

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:40.770
However, I am sorry to say that tonight...

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.270
You will be the prisoner, and I will be the guard.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.720
Remove that filthy hand.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.780
You want some time in the disciplinary room?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.030
If you want to play prison guard,

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.590
you need to pay what you owe.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:56.050
Or else you're headed straight to the slammer.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:01.110
You prisoners are only walking free because I allow you to.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.280
That hand better be removed when I stop smiling.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.590
Actually, I think they'll be

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:09.040
sending you somewhere else instead of the slammer.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.880
This is your last warning.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.080
Remove the hand.

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:14.730
You won't have another chance to

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.550
correct your mistake once I throw your ass in jail.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.940
Heh, amusing.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.010
Throw my ass in jail?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:24.210
I wanna see you try it, you sick warden!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:30.820
<b>So in the Second Season of Prison Break, They've Already Broken Out of Prison, But the Name Works Once You Realize That Society is a Prison</b>

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.200
I have a depraved samurai here who

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.990
was making threats and took a couple of kids

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.740
to an adult establishment.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.320
Keep an eye on him.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.830
Yes, Warden Beri!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:44.080
H-He's the real thing!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.820
W-Wait a moment!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.020
Nobody told me this would happen!

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.740
Is it really okay for that thug to be a prison guard?!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.450
Let me out! I'm innocent!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.140
The real culprit is that sick warden!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.090
Newbie.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.090
Save your yapping for roll call, will you?

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.200
Sorry, Gramps.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.560
I don't intend to be part of any roll call.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:06.350
That nasty fellow threw you in here, right?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.110
You won't last long if you disobey him.

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:12.810
Kuzunosuke Beri.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.810
He's the head warden here.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:18.580
He's involved in a lot of dirty business such as torturing prisoners.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.810
The law won't do you any good here.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.620
We're in his kingdom.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.860
Th-That's not funny...

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.640
It won't be long before my people produce evidence

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.130
that I was framed and prove my innocence.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.380
Gin-san, we did it!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.580
After a lot of running around,

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.100
we were able to get your sentence reduced!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:41.390
Only two years of prison time! You'll be out in no time! Isn't it great?

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.900
I see. Only two years...

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.770
...my ass!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.390
Why are you acting like this is good news when it's terrible news?!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.210
Unfortunately, there's already been

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:53.590
a lot of information manipulation going on.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:57.410
The report has Gin-chan as the one who was making trouble,

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.610
and it even says that you assaulted that guard.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:01.180
Son of a bitch!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:04.410
So he's blaming me for the crime and his freaky role playing?!

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:08.750
That warden was always a troublemaker,

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:11.080
but his father happens to be a big cop

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.080
with enough connections to get him this job.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.420
His ass is covered.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.700
In any case, we'll have to poke around some more.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:23.820
Anyway, we'll do what we can, so hang in there.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.430
Keep your asshole safe.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.130
This isn't funny.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.480
If our positions were switched

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:34.400
and they'd been thrown in prison for robbing a bank,

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.850
I'd sneak into the prison with an escape plan tattooed all over me,

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.940
if that's what it takes to save them.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:44.450
Youngster, sometimes there is perspective to be gained by giving up.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:48.050
Were you also framed by that rotten guard?

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.370
I'm just your average two-bit criminal.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.760
What'd you do?

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:55.390
I can't remember that far back.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:56.960
How long are you in here?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.580
I believe that I still have...

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.940
...210 years.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.720
Guard! Please put me in a different room!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:08.760
I used to plot ways to escape, but I gave up a long time ago.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.970
No shit!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.310
And what'd you do to warrant a 200-year sentence?!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.940
That's like Demon King Piccolo level!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:18.480
As a result, I've realized what I should be doing.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.450
<b>How are you doing? It's a lovely day outside. We had rice, fish, miso soup, and takuan for dinner.</b>

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.280
You were writing a letter earlier, too.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:21.860
Who is that to...

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.550
You still haven't given up on that?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.900
Put yourself in the shoes of a son

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.540
who receives letters from his criminal of a father.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:36.130
Good warden, I appreciate your assistance.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.550
Hold on.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.800
Whether you're on the inside or the outside,

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.860
nothing comes free in this world.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.100
I paid you at the beginning of the month.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:50.000
You're only allowed to receive stuff from the outside once a month.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.100
Yet I'm putting in the effort to bring you letters every week.

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.680
Hey, bastard.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:00.160
You enjoy shaking old geezers for change?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.080
Do you need the money to play a crane game?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.740
S-Stop it, Newbie!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.360
Crane game...

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:06.950
Sounds about right,

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.660
since I love playing with the toys in this pen.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.960
You sure know how to have a good time.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.420
Let me join in.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.180
This is my personal privilege.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.780
I'll play with you soon enough.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.920
Sorry, but I already had my fun.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.680
Gramps, is this what you wanted?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.040
Guess you owe me now.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.430
Bastard! When did you...

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:32.100
Sorry, you looked like one of

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:35.310
those ugly stuffed animals in a crane game.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.810
B-Bastard...

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:42.570
Don't forget.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:48.070
You'll soon find out what happens to people who oppose me.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.190
I guarantee it.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:08:00.590
Man, I told you to behave.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.660
If you're trying to show your appreciation, give me your dessert.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.880
You're not getting my pudding.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.080
But I'll give you my sliced radishes

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.870
tomorrow and the day after that.

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.340
You're just giving me the stuff you don't like.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.320
What was in the letter?

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.780
Just some small talk.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:19.760
You're bribing that warden so you can make small talk?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.880
I have no other use for my money when I'm stuck

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.360
here another 200 years.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:29.360
I'm an old man in prison.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.940
I'm sure that my family has suffered because of my actions.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:39.120
But my son's the only one left to make amends with.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:44.380
I never expected him to reply or forgive me,

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:49.090
but soon, I was receiving replies regularly.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:56.390
Now, I'm basically living for the sake of his small talk.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.710
Why don't you just have him visit

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.310
instead of going through all this trouble?

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.380
A felon like me isn't allowed visitors.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.400
But after spending years writing letters,

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.540
I've become a model prisoner.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.780
In one week, they'll grant me clemency.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.160
You'll be able to see your son?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.330
Yes, in one week,

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:19.920
as long as there isn't any trouble.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.420
I understand that you've been thrown in here

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.420
for a crime you didn't commit.

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:29.290
But for one week, until I meet my son,

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.100
I ask that you don't make any trouble.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.680
Please...

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.520
Please...

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.240
Let's make a deal.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.330
I'm going to help sustain your lifestyle,

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.480
so you should help me with mine.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.980
What?

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.200
Wh-Why you...

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:52.360
Not that!

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:53.440
Gramps!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.990
You call yourself a model prisoner?!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.890
Look at you making a huge fuss over pudding!

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:58.090
Give it back!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.750
Give back my bouncy pudding!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.870
Do you care more about your son or your pudding?!

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.540
My s-sonding!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.620
What the hell is a sonding?!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.080
The title of some Jump Square series?!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.630
Hey! What's all the noise about?!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:10.130
Nothing! Just having a discussion about a bouncy pudding!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.530
Don't lie to me!

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:13.010
That's an erect pudding!

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.390
No, it's a bouncy pudding!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:15.360
'Fess up!

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.920
This is clearly an erect pudding!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.890
No, it's most definitely a bouncy pudding!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.080
What the hell?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.580
You were about to lose your chance

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.900
to see your son because of a pudding.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:26.940
Listen to me.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.900
You better give me my pudding back once the week is up.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.250
Man...

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:32.780
Understand?

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.780
I'm sure that you don't want any trouble with the warden...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.410
I understand perfectly.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.790
These guys want to make trouble.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:45.150
Th-That's...

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.050
Shachi!

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:53.470
A vicious felon who was locked up on the Devil's Island,

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:57.550
but the warden used his connections to bring him here as an underling!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.200
The King of Criminals!

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.560
Shachi the Killer!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:03.120
N-Not good!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:08.190
Yo, so you're the newbie with a lot of spirit?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.690
The warden told us about you.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:15.460
He said there were a couple of punching bags that wouldn't fight back.

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.690
Some new toys for us to play with.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.660
Shachi, which one do you want?

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:23.330
I would prefer the younger one,

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.000
but I like the idea of beating an old man to death.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:33.550
Wh-What's with that look?

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.300
You wanna fight?

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:40.100
You don't care if you never get to see your son again?!

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.100
No! He's gonna kill me!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:51.140
There are jellyfish on your shoulders.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.280
Fashion!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.630
Those are for fashion!

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.700
To show that he's the king of this prison!

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.610
And your gloves are so worn that your fingers are sticking out.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.170
You should patch them up,

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.910
since I'm the only one who seems to have noticed.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.470
You making fun of him, you bastard?!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.780
Those aren't jellyfish! They're shoulder pads!

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.670
That's how they're supposed to look!

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.950
What? You all knew?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:15.740
So you've been holding back your laughter?

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:16.910
Hell no!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.430
This is Shachi's new snappy outfit!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.140
Outfit?

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:25.040
So you cut the fingers off your gloves?

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.130
Why would you do that?

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.400
You could just take off the gloves if they're too tight.

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:31.540
Are the scars on your forehead the same?

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.330
You cut yourself up?

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.080
I guess it wouldn't make sense for actual scars to be so perfectly aligned.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:36.870
Why?

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:39.090
Why would you hurt yourself like that?

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:40.130
Hey, stop it!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.640
Just drop the subject!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.290
Don't provoke Shachi anymore!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.330
I-It was just...

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.660
My face was all itchy from a mosquito bite,

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.400
and when I scratched it, my forehead ended up like this.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:51.620
Shachi!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.250
You're blushing, Shachi!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.800
You're destroying your image!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:58.620
It's not like I wanted an X on my forehead.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.590
I'm fine with turning it into a semicolon.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.680
Stop, Shachi!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.770
You look cool! The X is cool!

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.430
Don't worry! You're rocking that X!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.690
I don't care if I look cool or not.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:13.110
And I don't care how my clothes look if they're comfortable!

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:16.190
I'm never gonna wear shoulder pads again!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.670
A hissy fit!

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:19.190
Shachi's throwing a hissy fit!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:19.950
Hey, bastard!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.650
You said that someone was laughing at me?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.970
Nobody was laughing!

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.300
Nobody was laughing at you, Shachi!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:26.350
Tell me who it was!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:27.290
No, Shachi!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.180
He's messing with you!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.620
You're letting him mess with you!

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.460
Sorry, I can't tell you.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:36.630
I might be in prison, but I ain't lousy enough to squeal.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.130
H-Hey, what's he doing?

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:40.400
Impossible...

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.720
Is he protecting us?

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.680
If I squeal, you'll kill him, right?

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:51.150
We can't afford to cause any trouble right now.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.860
I don't give a damn!

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:56.630
If I let this go, my street cred is ruined!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:59.280
Now I have to kill you!

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.460
That would be smart.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.530
I won't have to rat out my buddies.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:07.870
And you won't have to kill yours.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.830
We're both grown men.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.880
So man up.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.810
That's the second time I've seen

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.880
a person with that look in this cesspool.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.550
Boys, line up and close your eyes.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.390
Huh?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.760
I'll let you settle this.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.390
Don't worry.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:33.650
We didn't see anything happen, and we know nothing.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:36.140
I didn't see this coming!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:36.900
What is he doing?!

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:38.580
What is he trying to do?!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.690
Run.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:41.730
I see!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.610
We're going to use this chance to run away, newbie!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.700
Oof.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:53.460
Wh-Wha...

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.460
What are you doing?!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.500
H-Hey!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.970
What's the meaning of this?!

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.050
If I only punished one of them,

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.910
you'd be able to tell who it was from his injuries.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:09.350
So we'll just have everyone share the pain, and you can let this go.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.410
Take care of your buddies.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:18.660
B-Bro!

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:25.860
Looks like you got in a big fight.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.690
No, we just had a little internal scuffle.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.150
Huh?

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.250
Just give me my pudding, old timer.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.380
What?

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:38.250
H-Hey, don't think you'll get away with disrespecting me...

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.210
Bro! Bro!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.540
What the hell?!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.060
Bro!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.290
After the newbie turned Shachi's gang to his side,

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:57.080
the warden continued to harass him.

00:15:57.710 --> 00:15:59.890
Listen up, freaks!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.430
Mr. Katou, the guard here had something stolen from him!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.860
We'll be searching each cell!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:08.120
I found a strange DVD in cell 316!

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.690
That's my porn!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.000
Cell 316...

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.260
Sakata, it was you?!

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.780
You're headed straight to the disciplinary room!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.750
Why would I steal a DVD when I'm stuck in a cell without a TV?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.010
You haven't had any contact with women.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.970
The cover is all you needed.

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.590
I don't let the cover fool me!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.220
I also check the images on the back!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.340
Shut up!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.770
In any case, this DVD was under your bed!

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:38.300
Warden, nobody said anything about this DVD being under my bed.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:40.240
How did you know where it was?

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.190
Enough of your chatter!

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:45.260
I saw him pull the DVD out from under your bed!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.460
You saw him pull it out?

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:47.750
Then...

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.950
Why didn't you notice that the cover had been removed?

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.670
Th-That's because...

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.530
I borrowed that DVD once.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.080
And it had a cover back then.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.200
With images on it...

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.260
Y-Yes!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:04.240
There was a cover on it yesterday!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.090
You must be trying to conceal the evidence!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.590
Oh, really.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.950
If it was there yesterday and it's gone now,

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.960
the person who removed the cover must be the culprit.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.430
Isn't that right?

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:20.190
Thank you for confessing to the crime, Warden.

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:21.190
<b>Bound Prisoner</b>

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:22.190
Th-This is...!

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.410
Could he have slipped it in then?!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.960
Enough already!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.100
Who do you think you are, trying to frame our bro?!

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.480
Don't screw with us!

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:30.960
No...

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.790
A guard stealing?! Have you no shame?!

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.950
You should cut open your belly.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.520
Seppuku! Seppuku! Seppuku!

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:38.520
Bastard...

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.960
He turned my own trap against me!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.130
Seppuku! Seppuku!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.970
Boys, that's enough.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:49.040
I'm sure he just shifted the blame on me

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.930
because he forgot to return the DVD.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.290
Let him have his cover art,

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.720
since that's all the warden apparently needs.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:59.810
He definitely isn't getting any!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.520
Man, that guy is a joke.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.240
I'm not equipped to deal with a kid in puberty.

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:11.680
Did he finish his letter?

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:14.250
Hand it over then.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.330
The evil guard is delivering mail in the middle of the night?

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:20.430
You're pretty diligent.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.740
Remember this.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.950
When an evil guard comes to see you in secret,

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.040
it's either to make a deal or to make a threat.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.280
I'm not interested in either.

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.840
Even if I'm offering to set you free?

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.400
It's very simple.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.850
I need you to start a ruckus.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.350
Play the role of a troublemaker.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:45.700
If you do as I say, I'll give you a ticket to freedom.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:49.360
Let's just cut to the chase.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.360
You want to screw up the plans of Gramps here.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.350
All that pestering him for money was just to provoke him.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:59.120
You were trying to drive him into making trouble.

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:01.860
That's why you were picking a fight with me.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:03.860
You wanted him to be associated with a troublemaker

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.130
so you could get his clemency revoked.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.130
So he won't be able to see his son...

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:11.860
Yet you keep delivering his letters.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:13.450
What's the deal?

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:18.100
Like I said, I enjoy playing with the toys in this pen.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.670
Give that letter to Gramps.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.580
When it comes time to break a toy,

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:30.650
the higher they are, the harder they fall.

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.570
Bro!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.910
Say "ahhh"!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.520
Hey, why are you turning my happy dessert time

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:47.420
into a Resident Evil moment?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:51.040
Because you don't seem to have much of an appetite...

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.100
That's because you've been spreading T-Virus everywhere.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.580
Go back to Raccoon City!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.550
I'll eat it for you then...

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:01.680
A living corpse should eat porridge and go, "Itchy. Tasty."

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:07.610
Oh, I believe that you sent out that letter for me yesterday.

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:08.800
I appreciate it.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.240
Was there a reply yet?

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:12.540
Nope.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.190
I see...

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.820
Hey, Gramps.

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:18.110
Did your long-awaited meeting fall through?

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:18.930
Eh?!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.200
Of course not!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:24.600
Didn't you send an entry to the Shounen Jump Treasure contest?!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.370
Did you get a reply?!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.000
How did you know that?!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:32.390
A prisoner was about to kill himself when a reaper appeared before him!

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.590
Could you be any more emo?!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:38.170
Hey, stop it, Gramps.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.320
Don't worry, Bro.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:43.360
Ever since you chased off the warden,

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:47.140
he's been too embarrassed to show himself.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.650
We can use this chance to take revenge on the

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.670
guards who have abused us.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:54.950
Riot!

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.730
Let's pull a prison version of Resident Evil

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.410
and teach that evil warden a lesson!

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.410
If you do that, all of the prisoners will be blamed.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:08.240
You criminals on death row probably don't care,

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.250
but I'm an innocent man.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:13.080
Bro! We're not on death row!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.670
You are.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.600
Since you were born, you've had crows

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:18.590
pecking at your brain until it was passport-sized.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.650
Yeah!

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:22.040
I won't get to see my son!

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.070
You'll lose your shot at the Treasure award!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.140
I haven't lost my shot!

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.230
It hasn't even started!

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:31.100
Bah, I'll give up since my Treasure award is on the line.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:35.830
But Bro, the prisoners here hate the warden's guts.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:37.730
Especially the felons.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.860
They have nothing to lose, so who knows what they'll do.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.500
If they get started, we won't be able to stop them.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.040
Good grief.

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:50.500
You got plenty of troublemakers here, warden.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:59.510
<b>Admit Your Own Mistakes</b>

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:55.410
Gramps, you better keep an eye on them if you want to see your son.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:59.510
I'll deal with the warden before he gets any funny ideas.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:01.010
How?

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.410
I'll start a ruckus.

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:08.020
But it's going to be my own.

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:10.060
<b>To be continued...</b>

00:23:40.030 --> 00:23:44.990
<b>Next Episode:
Everybody Loves Pajamas</b>

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:41.750
Next time:

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:43.360
Everybody loves pajamas.

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:44.400
Jammies!
